{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 37","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_37&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The formula <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/c/26c303354ed9849af8fe60828a8ea1b6363255a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=\\frac{1}{1-r}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"82\" height=\"40\" /> can be used to determine the sum of an infinite geometric series with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> as its first term and common ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/a/6ea8a70fb7427691af71195da4744550882c8fcd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=5$\" width=\"45\" height=\"12\" />, what is the value <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/f/bef3884dfc0d1c44736768c71e9412012c8a3afa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\  -4 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\  -\\frac{1}{4} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\  \\frac{1}{5} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\  \\frac{4}{5} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\  \\frac{5}{4} \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"445\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_37&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/c/ddcaa9ce7c1e8ce77ff3c69d99fb2c0b3e336a70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 = \\frac{1}{1 - r}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"79\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/9/c29094b99e50f4b5acc9de24f3f81eaa4adbadbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5(1 - r) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"98\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/2/432b925865b3693a43b3309536c2ddd7282bd663.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 - 5r = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/9/379d16ce896e7efabb6b64ea0d10bc73e38cf0c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-5r = 1 - 5 = -4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"146\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/c/b5c226b121948f3ecda6832bae6f44a0674c413a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = \\frac{-4}{-5} = \\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } \\frac{4}{5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"146\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>¬anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest\">2025 TMTA Algebra I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 36\">Problem 36</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 38\">Problem 38</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=202